    "language": "en",
    "md5": "c2556320804174d301a1818d839a3f05",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1513,
    "chunk_text": "(c) exercise supervision and control over programmesbroadcast by the Sri Lanka Broadcasting Corporationor the Sri Lanka Rupavahini Corporation, as the casemay be, relating to an election or a referendum ;\n\nShort Title.\n\nPowers andfunctions of theCompetentAuthority.\n\nCompetent Authority (Powers and Functions)Act, No. 3 of 20022\n\n(e) exercise and perform in relation to any broadcastpertaining to an election or a referendum as the casemay be, all such powers and functions as are conferredor imposed on or assigned to, either the Sri LankaBroadcasting Corporation or the Sri Lanka RupavahiniCorporation as the case may be, by the Sri LankaBroadcasting Corporation Act, No. 37 of 1966 or theSri Lanka Rupavahini Corporation Act, No. 6 of 1982respectively ;\n\n(f) establish, install and operate broadcasting apparatus ;\n\n(g) acquire by way of lease, sublease or otherwise anyland or interest in land, with or without any building ;\n\n(h) erect, alter or reconstruct any broadcasting apparatusor any building or structure on any land belonging toor administered by the Sri Lanka BroadcastingCorporation or the Sri Lanka Rupavahini Corporation,as the case may be, for the use in connection with anybroadcasting station or in connection with the exerciseand discharge of its powers and functions ;\n\n(i) acquire by lease or otherwise, during the period forwhich the Competent Authority is appointed, anyproperty, rights or privileges that it considers necessaryfor exercising and discharging of its powers andfunctions ;"
  },
