    "chunk_size_bytes": 2018,
    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00 Postage : Rs. 3.50\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka of August 18, 2000\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nTEA SHAKTHI FUND\n\nACT, No. 47 OF 2000\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 18th August, 2000]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n1Tea Shakthi Fund Act, No. 47 of 2000\n\n2\u2014H 008056\u20145,550 (07/00)\n\n[Certified on 18th August, 2000]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 19/98.\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF A FUND CALLEDTEA SHAKTHI FUND ; TO SPECIFY ITS OBJECTS AND POWERS ;\n\nAND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR\n\nINCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Tea Shakthi Fund Act,No. 47 of 2000.\n\n2.(1) There shall be established a fund which shall becalled the Tea Shakthi Fund (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheFund\u201d).\n\n(2) The Fund shall, by the name assigned to it by subsection(1), be a body corporate and shall have perpetual successionand a common seal and may sue and be sued in such name.\n\n3.(1) The administration, management and control, ofthe Fund shall be vested in a Board of Management,(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d), constituted ashereinafter provided.\n\n(2) The Board shall consist of the following membersappointed by the Minister\u2014\n\n(i) the Chairman of the Tea Small Holdings Authority(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAuthority\u201d)established by the Tea Small Holdings DevelopmentLaw, No. 35 of 1975 ;\n\n(ii) the General Manager of the Authority ;\n\n(iii) the Deputy General Manager (Finance) of theAuthority ;\n\nConstitution of theBoard ofManagement ofthe Fund.\n\nEstablishment ofTea Shakthi Fund.\n\nShort title.\n\n2Tea Shakthi Fund Act, No. 47 of 2000"
  },
