    "chunk_size_bytes": 1883,
    "chunk_text": "2. From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of theInternational Shanthee Dharma Organisation (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Organisation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admittedas members of the corporation hereby constituted shall be abody corporate (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d)with perpetual succession, under the name and style of\u201cInternational Shanthee Dharma Organisation\u201d and by thatname may sue and be sued in all courts with full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and to alter the sameat its discretion.\n\n(a) to promote universal brotherhood amongst allsections of the people;\n\n(b) to assist in the promotion of racial, religious andcommunal harmony, and the eradication of socialdisabilities;\n\nIncorporation ofthe InternationalShanthee DharmaOrganisation.\n\nGeneral objects ofthe Corporation.\n\n2International Shanthee Dharma Organisation(Incorporation) Act, No. 43 of 1999\n\n(c) to co-operate with local and foreign organisationsin the pursuit of peace and harmony among thepeople;\n\n(d) to promote and encourage the study of all religionsand all systems of philosophy;\n\n(e) to establish, maintain, control and manage,hospitals, clinics, diagnostic centres, communityhalls, and to extend medical relief and aid in anymanner to the needy ;\n\n(f) to train students and other persons for a life ofdedication and service to mankind and for thepropagation of culture ;\n\n(g) to train students in small industries and to help them,financially or otherwise, to establish themselves asuseful citizens ;\n\n(h) to construct, maintain and administer, orphanages,children\u2019s parks, cultural centres, schools andcolleges ;\n\n(i) to give aid, by way of scholarships or awards or aidin cash or in kind, to monks, volunteers and otherpersons engaged in the propagation of the objectsof the Corporation ;"
