    "chunk_size_bytes": 1546,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Periya Moulana, ZainMoulana Shrines and Thakiyas Development Society(Incorporation) Act, No.26 of 1999.\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof PeriyaMoulana, ZainMoulanaShrines andThakiyasDevelopmentSociety.\n\nH-022545\n\n2Periya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines andThakiyas Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 1999\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be -(a) to assist in the rehabilitation, maintenance,development and upkeep of the Shrines andThakiyas and the places of Muslim religiouspilgrimage and resort ;\n\n(b) to promote the welfare, comfort and well being ofpilgrims who may visit, venerate or seek succourand rest in, such places of pilgrimage, or who de-sire to observe Islamic rules of worship and prayer;\n\n(c) to promote in general, the religious, cultural,educational and economic well being and Welfareof Muslims ;\n\n(d) to provide relief and aid to the poor, the needy thesick and the aged of the Muslim faith visiting theShrines and Thakiyas, and any other relief such asthe provisions of social services, Educational andTraining facilities of all manner and description tothe Muslim Community in general ;\n\n(e) to establish and maintain a Muslim religious schoolfor the teaching of Quran and the Arabic Language;and\n\n(f) do such other acts and things as are conducive orincidental to the attainment of all or any of the aboveobjects."
  },
