    "chunk_text": "10. Nothing in this Act contained shall prejudice oraffect the rights of the Republic, or of any body politic orcorporate or of any other persons except such as arementioned in this Act, and those claiming by, from, or under ,them.\n\nSCHEDULE [section 5 (2)]\n\nBOARD OF TRUSTEES\n\n1. His Eminence Saiyad Omar Zain Barulba Alavi Moulana.\n\n2. His Eminence Seyed Ali Hibsny Moulana.\n\n3. His Eminence Saiyed Aftharb Omar Barulba AlaviMoulana.\n\n4. His Eminence Saiyad Tharbish Omar Barulba AlaviMoulana.\n\nDebts due by andpayable to theDevelopmentSociety.\n\nSeal of theCorporation.\n\nSaving of therights of theRepublic andothers.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\n5Periya Moulana, Zain Moulana Shrines andThakiyas Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 1999\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs.885 (Local). Rs.1,180 (Foreign),Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT. GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, No. 32, TRANSWORKS HOUSE,LOTUS ROAD, COLOMBO 01 before 15th December each year in respect of the year following."
