    "chunk_text": "17Agricultural and Agrarian InsuranceAct, No.20 of 1999\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nAGRICULTURAL AND AGRARIAN INSURANCEACT, NO. 20 OF 1999\n\n[Certified on 16th July, 1999]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of July 16, 1999.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.TO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice: Rs. 11.50 Postage: Rs.5.25\n\n(Internet Version)\n\n1Agricultural and Agrarian InsuranceAct, No.20 of 1999\n\n[Certified on 16th July, 1999]\n\nL.D.-O. 24/98.\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF ANAGRICULTURAL AND AGRARIAN INSURANCE BOARD TO\n\nPROVIDE INSURANCE OF AGRICULTURAL AND HORTICULTURAL\n\nCROPS AND MEDICINAL PLANTS, LIVESTOCK, FISHERIES AND\n\nFORESTRY, AGRICULTURAL EQUIPMENT AND IMPLEMENTS AND\n\nTHE STORAGE AND PRESERVATION OF AGRICULTURAL AND\n\nHORTICULTURAL PRODUCE AND THE PRODUCTS OF MEDICINAL\n\nPLANTS, FISHERIES AND FOREST PRODUCE; TO PROVIDE\n\nMEDICAL BENEFITS AND SOCIAL SECURITY SCHEMES FOR\n\nAGRICULTURISTS; TO REPEAL THE AGRICULTURAL INSURANCELAW, NO.27 OF 1973 ; AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS\n\nCONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Agricultural andAgrarian Insurance Act, No.20 of 1999 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by Orderpublished in the Gazette (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheappointed date\u201d)\n\nPART I\n\nTHE AGRICULTURAL AND AGRARIAN INSURANCE BOARD\n\n2. (1) There shall be established a Board which shall becalled the Agricultural and Agrarian Insurance Board (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d)\n\n(2) The Board shall by the name assigned to it bysubsection (1), be a body corporate with perpetualsuccession and a common seal and may sue and be sued insuch name."
