    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This act may be cited as the Kesbewa DevelopmentFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 10 of 1999.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be -\n\n(a) to promote and engage in the implementation ofcommunity welfare, cultural and social developmentprojects in Sri Lanka:\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof the KesbewaDevelopmentFoundation.\n\nGeneral objectsof theCorporation.\n\n2Kesbewa Development Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No.10 of 1999"
