    "md5": "de73072267fa7144a4b20a8c819e2b57",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1492,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This act may be cited as the PasyodunrataDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No.5 of 1999.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be -\n\n(a) to promote community based organisations;\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporation ofthe PasyodunrataDevelopmentFoundation.\n\nGeneral objects.\n\nH-022545\n\n2Pasyodunrata Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No.5 of 1999\n\n(b) to builed up the capacity of such organisations;\n\n(c) to promote the educations of the under privileged;\n\n(d) to carry out relief, rehabilitation and reconstructionprogrammes;\n\n(e) to promote health education, and to provideinformation on the eradication of malnutrition;\n\n(f) to further, the welfare and development of theunder privileged;\n\n(g) to promote income generating projects in theplantations as well as in the villages, and to launchself help projects, with a view to generatingemployment;\n\n(h) to provide assistance to relive distress caused bynatural disasters such as floods, cyclones anddroughts ;\n\n(i) to disseminate knowledge and information onimproved methods of agriculture , horticultureaquaculture, sericulture, animal husbandry, freshwater fisheries and bee keeping, through thepublication and distribution of books andpamphlets and the conduct of seminars, workshops,lectures and film shows;\n\n(j) to promote thrift among the under privileged."
  },
